  "id": "293b2334-b70e-5e1d-b5fe-c55c38acb34b",
  "rev": 3,
  "name": "pv-suite audit trail",
  "summary": "The pv-suite family audit trail: the syslog input, the audit_* parse, the streams and the event definitions.",
  "description": "Operator content for pointing Graylog at the pv-suite audit trail (--audit-forward udp://<graylog>:1514 with the default rfc5424 format). Creates one syslog UDP input on 1514, three pipeline rules that parse the KV line into audit_* fields, one pipeline wired to the Audit - all stream, five streams and four event definitions (no notifications attached - attach your own). The chain verification stays off-box: dev/gates/audit_verify.py over the collected file.",
  "vendor": "pv-suite",
  "url": "https://github.com/wework5119/opencode",
  "parameters": [],
  "entities": [
    {
